 neural networks could predict the target sequence perfectly with fewer recurrent units than the GRU neural network. Overall, these results may provide insights into how the nervous system optimally encodes sequences of items.  ","topics":[],"score":180337,"global_rank":430314},{"name":"pratmodi/SpringAssignment","owner":"pratmodi","html_url":"https://github.com/pratmodi/SpringAssignment","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"IMCS First Spring Assignment","topics":[],"score":180337,"global_rank":430315},{"name":"pratmodi/pratmodi","owner":"pratmodi","html_url":"https://github.com/pratmodi/pratmodi","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Config files for my GitHub profile.","topics":["config","github-config"],"score":180337,"global_rank":430316},{"name":"candiedoperation/capteur","owner":"candiedoperation","html_url":"https://github.com/candiedoperation/capteur","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Monitor Hardware Performance, In just one click","topics":[],"score":180337,"global_rank":430317},{"name":"kcmuse/first-repo-kc","owner":"kcmuse","html_url":"https://github.com/kcmuse/first-repo-kc","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180337,"global_rank":430318},{"name":"ltxom/ltxom","owner":"ltxom","html_url":"https://github.com/ltxom/ltxom","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180337,"global_rank":430319},{"name":"jersonmorrow/hooks-training","owner":"jersonmorrow","html_url":"https://github.com/jersonmorrow/hooks-training","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180337,"global_rank":430320},{"name":"jstoecker/dxcompute-docs","owner":"jstoecker","html_url":"https://github.com/jstoecker/dxcompute-docs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other"